# Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the JS bundle, so never put a
# secret here.
#
# You normally do not need to change this. `src/lib/config.ts` takes the host
# from the Expo dev server — the machine that served this bundle, which is by
# definition reachable from the device — and keeps only the port from here. So
# `localhost` works on a simulator, on an emulator and on a physical phone
# without being edited.
#
# Point it at a real host (a staging server, an ngrok tunnel) and that is
# honoured exactly as written, on every platform.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
